msgid "No completed history for this exercise yet — starting at the prescribed target."
msgstr "Ingen genomförd historik för denna övning ännu — startar vid det föreskrivna målet."

msgid "Manual progression — you control the next weight and target."
msgstr "Manuell progression — du styr nästa vikt och mål."

msgid "Missed the target %(streak)s sessions in a row at %(weight)s kg — even maintenance loading should come down, to %(deload)s kg."
msgstr "Missade målet %(streak)s pass i rad vid %(weight)s kg — även underhållsbelastningen bör sänkas, till %(deload)s kg."

msgid "Maintenance — keeping the same load."
msgstr "Underhåll — behåller samma belastning."

msgid "Hit every rep last session at %(weight)s kg — adding %(increment)s kg."
msgstr "Klarade alla repetitioner senaste passet vid %(weight)s kg — lägger till %(increment)s kg."

msgid "Missed target reps %(streak)s sessions in a row at %(weight)s kg — recommending a deload to %(deload)s kg."
msgstr "Missade repetitionsmålet %(streak)s pass i rad vid %(weight)s kg — rekommenderar avlastning till %(deload)s kg."

msgid "Missed target reps last session at %(weight)s kg — try the same weight again before increasing."
msgstr "Missade repetitionsmålet senaste passet vid %(weight)s kg — prova samma vikt igen innan du ökar."

msgid "Hit the top of your rep range on every set at %(weight)s kg — adding %(increment)s kg and resetting to the bottom of the range."
msgstr "Nådde toppen av repetitionsintervallet i varje set vid %(weight)s kg — lägger till %(increment)s kg och återställer till intervallets botten."

msgid "Still within your rep range at %(weight)s kg — repeat the same weight and aim for more reps next time."
msgstr "Fortfarande inom repetitionsintervallet vid %(weight)s kg — upprepa samma vikt och sikta på fler repetitioner nästa gång."

msgid "Missed the bottom of your rep range %(streak)s sessions in a row at %(weight)s kg — recommending a deload to %(deload)s kg."
msgstr "Missade botten av repetitionsintervallet %(streak)s pass i rad vid %(weight)s kg — rekommenderar avlastning till %(deload)s kg."

msgid "Missed the bottom of your rep range last session at %(weight)s kg — try the same weight again."
msgstr "Missade botten av repetitionsintervallet senaste passet vid %(weight)s kg — prova samma vikt igen."

msgid "Hit the top of your rep range for %(streak)s sessions in a row at %(weight)s kg — adding %(increment)s kg."
msgstr "Nådde toppen av repetitionsintervallet %(streak)s pass i rad vid %(weight)s kg — lägger till %(increment)s kg."

msgid "Within your rep range at %(weight)s kg — keep working toward the top of the range before increasing."
msgstr "Inom repetitionsintervallet vid %(weight)s kg — fortsätt jobba mot toppen av intervallet innan du ökar."

